    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜ばいい: you could (gentle advice)",
     "texto": [
      "To suggest an option: ば form + **いい**: **でんしゃ で いけば いい です** (you could go by train)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜たらいい: you could (with care)",
     "texto": [
      "It can also give advice: たら form + **いい**: **まいにち すこし ずつ べんきょう したら いい です** (you could study a little every day). **ばいい** and **たらいい** overlap a lot; **ずつ** adds separately the idea of making slow progress."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
